        "Nikolay",
        "Kolya",
        "Kapral Nikolay"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Katarina: Nikolay",
      "content": "Nikolay Snezhevich, Katarina's younger brother, was a Kapral (corporal) in the Fatui's Ninth Company, raised in the House of the Hearth alongside her. He treasured the balalaika she gave him and kept repairing it. Before she joined his regiment he wrote her a warm letter. In the chaos of The Chasm he lured monsters away from the squad and disappeared; his diary says his left leg was badly wounded and ends when a swordsman in black, a Shadowy Husk, found him, with an apology to 'Katya'.",
