    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Lyudochka",
        "Lyudochka Snezhevna"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Katarina: Lyudochka",
      "content": "Katarina's closest friend from the House of the Hearth: someone who may seem serious but confided in her, teased her and looked after her. Katarina calls her a 'funny little pumpkin' and hopes she is doing her job well. Lyudochka is the Fatui spy in Inazuma who becomes Gendou Ringo.",
