    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Ninth Company",
        "Anton"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Katarina: The Ninth Company",
      "content": "A Fatui company of 64 soldiers, sent into The Chasm to investigate the mysterious forces there. According to the wiki they found the Chasm Nail, but their Mokosh device was overloaded and heavy casualties followed. By the time of A Company Vanishing Into the Deep roughly half had died or gone missing, including the commander. Anton, a survivor, regrets leaving Katarina to her search; he blames his own cause. The wiki says the Qixing cut their supply lines after the Fatui-Liyue clash; Anton adds that Pulcinella would dispense with less valuable assets.",
      "constant": false,
      "vectorized": false,
