    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "House of the Hearth",
        "Arlecchino's orphanage"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Katarina: House of the Hearth",
      "content": "The orphanage in Snezhnaya run by the Harbinger Arlecchino, where children are raised as 'children of the Tsaritsa' and later trained for the Fatui. Katarina, Nikolay and Lyudochka grew up there; Nikolay's letter remembers New Year gifts from the Tsaritsa and songs around the bonfire.",
