      "key": [
        "Glowing Narrows",
        "Katarina's hideout"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Katarina: The Glowing Narrows hideout",
      "content": "A hideout in The Chasm's Underground Mines that Katarina set up after getting lost searching for Nikolay. It holds a straw mat, hardtack, sour jam and Fire-Water; black tea, sugar and milk are gone. The Traveler can visit on several days; on the third she has left.",
